Architecture: the web page is the story shell that owns the resolved `YearReview` and
passes it to twelve PRESENTATIONAL slides. Reproduced exactly — ONE model, ONE projection,
all twelve slides rendered inline from that single DTO + the three page-level states. (The
seven standalone slide component surfaces already in feature-views are P3 library units with
their own per-slide state holders; the page does not depend on them, matching the web split.)

Parity arithmetic reproduced exactly from the web source (cross-platform value parity,
NOT a "corrected" version) — pinned by the executed host harness (49/49) below:
  distance        = convertDistanceFromSI(total_distance_km*1000, unit) ; fmtNumber(_,0) grouped
  earthLaps %     = fmtNumber(total_distance_km/40075*100, 1)
  energy days     = Math.round(total_energy_kwh/30)            [ungrouped i18next number]
  drive distance  = Math.round(convertDistanceFromSI(distance_km*1000, unit))   [ungrouped]
  drive duration  = h>0 ? "{h}h {m}m" : "{m}m"
  drive eff       = eff_wh_km>0 ? Math.round(unit=='mi'?eff*1.609344:eff) : "—"
  charging        = filter(value>0) then COLORS[filteredIndex % 3] ; Math.round(pct)
  savings hero    = "$" + fmtNumber(gas_savings,0) grouped ; bars "$"+Math.round(...) ungrouped
  electric width  = gasEquiv>0 ? round(tcc/gasEquiv*100)% : 0%
  coffee/trees    = Math.round(gas_savings/5) / Math.round(co2_offset_kg/21) ; tree grid min(_,30)
  patterns hour   = h>=12 ? "{h==12?12:h-12} PM" : "{h==0?12:h} AM"
  Title year      = fmtNumber(year,0) GROUPED "2,026" (AnimatedNumber) ; Summary header {year}
                    raw UNGROUPED "2026" — both web behaviours preserved verbatim.
  fmtNumber       = en_US grouped, fixed fraction, half-away-from-zero ; Math.round = floor(x+0.5).

